cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Driver Drowsiness Detection Comparison Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Derived analysis data, per-run training and evaluation records, and
  intermediate artefacts from a benchmark of lightweight driver drowsiness
  detection models built on vehicle-dynamics features, evaluated under class
  imbalance and cross-subject domain shift. Trained model binaries are
  deliberately excluded. All measurements derive from the openly deposited
  multi-modal driving dataset of Aygun et al. (2024).
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YutaroNakagama/vehicle_based_DDD_comparison"

# TODO before release: add `doi:` once the Zenodo DOI is minted, and add
