keywords:
  - driver drowsiness detection
  - vehicle dynamics
  - class imbalance
  - domain shift
  - domain generalization
  - subject-independent evaluation
  - SMOTE
  - Sobol sensitivity analysis
  - random forest
  - BiLSTM
  - EEG band power
  - Karolinska Sleepiness Scale

